 "scope": "Toy scale and fragile, per the adversarial checker: the m = 6 and m = 7 KILLs each rest on one censored or small-base step; under a slope-halving scenario m = 6 reads exponent 0.443 and m = 7 reads 0.370 (INCONCLUSIVE); the preset's only SURVIVE cell (m = 4, t = 4) was not run. A censored F4 run (D >= 8) does not certify that the degree-7 closure lacks 1. Open for m >= 8 (sigma = 1/m with w = 1 gives exponent 0.43 < 0.5) and asymptotically; no F4 or polynomial-calculus degree lower bound is proved. The owner's decisive cells (m = 4 at N = 20; m = 2 at t = 13/14) were not run. MANIFEST.sha256 re-checked 25/25 in the repo copy on 2026-11-15. No bench.record/v1.",
